WEBVTT

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.950
There's this expression, "June bride"...

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.620
"June bride"?

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:24.800
"Good Omens Surrounding Marriage"
"June Bride"

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.910
A June wedding is said to be
an omen of a happy marriage.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.200
We're right in the season for it.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.870
Oh, a June bride! It's every girl's dream.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:31.870
I wonder if Miss Caretaker dreams
of getting married, too...

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.540
Akkuuuuuun!

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.330
Sh-Shiina, watch what you're doing!

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:47.620
Oh, my goodness!

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.950
Ohhh, it's all wet...

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.950
I'm sorry!

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:51.000
I'll take care of it.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.950
"Start of the Rainy Season, Marriage, Lap Pillow"

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:31.620
This June bride thing.
Girls really think about stuff like that?

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:37.870
Well, we're too young to get married,
so naturally it's more of a fantasy, but...

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:41.450
That's the face of someone
who really wants to share.

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:42.500
President, do--

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:46.250
You want to hear more? Well, if you insist.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:51.870
I'd be an admirable wife who supports
her extremely hardworking man!

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.330
Here we go.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:56.250
"Sunohara House"

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:56.250
Honey, I'm home!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.700
Welcome home, dear!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.950
Will you have a bath? Will you have dinner?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.790
Or will you... have... <i>me</i> ?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.700
A scrub brush is more
than enough to take you out!

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.700
Ow! Ow!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.580
Did I hear "marriage"?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.120
Ms. Ayaka, are you getting married?

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.410
No, I'm not.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.830
Marriage...

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.330
Oh, Yuri, you're interested in the opposite sex?

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:22.700
That's more a question for you, Sumire.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.580
I guess I'd want to do
everything for my husband.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:29.580
So, eventually, he'd be
completely dependent on me.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:32.910
You don't need to work, dear.

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:35.200
A total "Good Wife, Wise Mother" situation.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.450
That's not what that means...

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:41.040
Marriage, huh? I've never thought about it.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.410
I know exactly how things would go.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.250
In public you'd be a hard-nosed career woman.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.540
Read over these documents.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.370
But at home you'd be a total softie.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.330
Purrr. I'm paws-itively pooped from work.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.450
Like that.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:57.250
I would never make such a stupid face!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.910
Ms. Ayaka, what's your image of marriage?

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.410
Ooh, tell us! Tell us!

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.700
Let's see...

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:11.160
If you and your partner support
each other, that's the ideal relationship.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.700
How mature.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:17.700
But for now, I'm not planning to get married.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:22.000
My life is plenty fulfilling as it is.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.790
She's a goddess!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:25.910
Phew!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.700
What about you, Shiina?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.120
M-Me?

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.330
Which of us would you marry?

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.000
What? I... Uh...

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:39.660
Know what? It doesn't matter.
We get to choose, too.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:40.750
Ouch.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.950
Supporting your partner...

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:50.620
There's nothing I can
really do for Miss Caretaker...

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:56.910
This is no good. At this rate,
when I eventually m-marry Miss Caretaker...

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.330
Akkun...

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:06.620
From now on, I'll take care of eeeeverything.

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:09.290
Gah! I even thought that might be nice!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.160
There must be something I can do.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.330
Something...

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.870
"Everyone <i>Loves</i>
a Man Who Cooks."

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:21.830
That's it!

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:28.080
All right. Ready!

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:36.000
Miss Caretaker, teach me how to cook, please.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.750
Oh! What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.910
I don't know. I just suddenly wanted to try it.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:45.910
I see.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:49.410
Then how about you do the prep work?

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.250
Prep work?

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:55.700
It takes some preparation
to make food that tastes good.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:59.580
First, you put the chicken
and spices in a bag, like this.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.290
Then you paw at it. Paw, paw.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.950
P-Paw...?

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:05.950
Yep. Paw, paw.

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.700
P-Paw...

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.910
Next, we cut the vegetables.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.790
Be very careful with the knife, okay?

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.620
I'll stay alert.

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:18.870
When you cut an onion,
curl your fingers into a cat paw.

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.540
A cat?

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:24.040
Right, a cat! Meow!

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.250
M-Meow...

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:32.660
Last is the potato salad.
Add the mayonnaise, please.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.250
This should be easy.

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:37.870
Huh? There's almost none left.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:41.120
Oh! When that happens...

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:43.790
...grab the rear end and shake it up and down.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:48.290
There! Now you can squeeze it all out.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.580
I see.

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:57.200
Oh, today is <i>karaage</i> ? Looks great!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.580
Akkun helped make it!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:00.910
Shiina did?!

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:03.580
Oh? You made this?

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:05.200
What a good bride you'll make.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.660
No, I won't!

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.120
Oh, no!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:15.700
Shiina's a better girl than I am!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.700
Girl?! B-B-But I was upping my manly appeal!

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:19.000
This is how you up your wife appeal.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.410
We're stuffed!

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.330
It wasn't supposed to turn out this way.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.580
President? What's wrong?

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:43.700
Hey, Shiina, remember
our talk about marriage?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:45.540
Yes?

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:48.450
Tell me: guys prefer big breasts, don't they?

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:58.290
I bought this in secret, but I've been
too embarrassed to try it on.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.870
He doesn't need to know why I ask.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:13.200
Wh-What brought this on?

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.000
Just answer me!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.750
M-My bubble!

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:22.540
Y-Yours are perfectly nice
just the way they are, President.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:25.450
Who said this was about my breasts?

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:26.950
Uh...

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:30.410
I don't need your sympathy!

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.410
I'm sorry!

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:36.700
Look, I'm the same age
as Sumire and Yuri, right?

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:39.160
But I'm much shorter than they are...

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:41.700
I can't help but think about it...

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:48.580
I see. The President and I have the same
complex, but she has to face it more often.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.500
I understand how you feel!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.500
You want boobs, too?

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.500
No, not that!

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.330
Wait, why are you talking to me about this?

00:08:57.330 --> 00:09:00.750
Wouldn't it be better to ask
Yuri and Yamanashi- <i>sempai</i> ?

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:04.790
How could I talk to them about it?
It's embarrassing.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:07.200
Besides, Sumire would oppose the idea.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:10.700
Cute and slight is right! No growing!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:11.910
That's true...

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:16.450
With you, it's not all that embarrassing,
and I have ways of keeping you quiet.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:19.120
Just what do you take me for?

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:25.000
This is the first time
I've actually been invited in.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.250
Stop staring.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.830
President, you have a computer?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:31.950
Yeah, I do.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:35.040
Glasses?! You never wear those.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:39.080
They reduce blue light. Don't I look smart?

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:41.750
But for what we're about to research...

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.200
Don't say it.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:46.120
Okay!

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:46.120
Wait, I'm doing it?

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.410
Haven't you been looking into it?

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:51.080
I guess not.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:55.200
R-Researching it myself
feels like admitting defeat.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.620
President, it won't type in Japanese.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.290
Listen to what I say!

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.080
Let's try "breast enhancement methods."

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:08.830
"Lymph massage"?
It seems you massage your armpits.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.750
Huh? Like this?

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:16.410
This feels like a situation
where I shouldn't look.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:17.950
Um, there's also--

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.200
Why aren't you reading it?

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:26.830
Let me see. Breast massage...
Breast size... N-Nipple...

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.910
What are you making me look at?! Dummy!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.450
So unfair!

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:41.040
When it comes to breasts,
wouldn't Miss Caretaker know best?

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:44.950
Akkun, just where have you been looking?

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.290
No, I...

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:52.410
It's bad manners to stare that much.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:57.750
Sorry, President, but I do like this size.
It's like I can feel her kindness.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:03.250
Wait, what if the bigger your heart,
the bigger your breasts are?

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:08.080
I have attained enlightenment.
I must inform the President.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.200
President, I finally got it!

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.000
Huh?

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:14.700
Huh?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.450
"Punched by Yuzu..."

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.700
So, what did you get?

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:31.540
Right. As you know, Miss Caretaker
is kind and has a big heart.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:36.080
In other words, if you develop a bigger heart,
you'll develop bigger boobs!

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.500
Oh?

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:49.870
"Caretaker's Room"

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.830
Ms. Ayaka, is that...

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:02.790
Oh, Yuzu. I found one of my old swimsuits.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:04.750
This really takes me back.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.870
Of course, it doesn't fit anymore.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:14.870
It's tiny! She went from that size to this one?!

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:17.580
That means I have a chance!

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:22.080
Banzai growth spurts!

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:25.540
Banzai!

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.160
Hurray! Hurray!

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:41.290
I better not tell her
it's from elementary school.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.540
What?!

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.500
You're repairing a leak?

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:08.750
Yes. It's already the rainy season,
so I need to do some emergency repairs.

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.450
Sorry for startling you.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:13.120
Then let me help you!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.660
But weren't you in the middle of studying?

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:20.950
Don't worry! Because of the President,
I'm used to having my studies interrupted.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:25.370
Wow!

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:30.330
So this is what it looks like up here.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.040
I can see so far!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.750
Akkun, be careful!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.580
Sorry.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:44.200
Is my heart pounding because of the height
or Miss Caretaker? I can't tell.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:49.000
There we go.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:52.040
This is really a pretty old building, isn't it?

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:57.870
My family has looked after students
in this dorm for decades now.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:03.120
Grandmother wants to preserve it
to preserve all the memories.

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:06.540
She sounds wonderful.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:10.870
She is. I want to carry out her wishes.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.750
All done!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:19.540
Now we just wait for
the carpenter to come next week.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.950
We finished faster than I expected.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:24.450
All thanks to your help, Akkun.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:27.500
No, I didn't... Huh?

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:30.750
Oh, no!

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.160
Oh, goodness.

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:35.370
Something must have made the ladder fall.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:38.790
What do we do? Yuzu and the gang
aren't home right now.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:43.040
I'll call the-- Oh, no! My phone's in my room.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:47.290
We're not that high up. Shall I hang on
to the eaves and find a way down?

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:50.290
Akkun, I can't let you do
something so dangerous!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.000
If someone's going down, it should be me.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.540
It's too dangerous
for you, too, Miss Caretaker.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:01.660
If someone would just pass by,
we could ask them to put the ladder up.

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:06.620
Let's not panic.
The girls will be back eventually.

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:11.700
I almost want to stay like this forever...

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.580
Sorry. I didn't think it would rain.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:32.330
It's not your fault.
It's the rainy season. Things happen.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:37.290
It's gotten a little cold, hasn't it?

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.540
I know!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.370
That's a little warmer, isn't it?

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.080
Yes. Thank you.

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:49.200
They're taking a long time, huh?

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:52.830
The student council does have a lot to do.

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:56.040
What if nobody comes?

00:15:56.040 --> 00:16:00.250
We'll end up living up here together...

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.410
Akkun, would you like more?

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:08.870
Yes, please!

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:15.500
Gah! I thought that would be nice, too!

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.120
Wh-Whoa!

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.120
Akkun!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.910
Are you all right?

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:24.540
S-Sorry.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:27.080
We've ended up in quite a position.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:28.950
What are you doing up here?

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:31.000
President?!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:36.250
I was repairing some leaks with Akkun.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.080
Looks more like you were being lovey-dovey.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:42.700
That's a misunderstanding!
The ladder fell and we couldn't get down.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:45.290
Oh, so that's what happened.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:51.410
When we got back, you were gone, but your
phones were still here. We got worried.

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:54.410
President, we should head back inside.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:59.160
Yeah. But, really. Your ladder fell?
How foolish can you--

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:13.160
Our umbrellas didn't help at all.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:16.950
♪ Bath time! Bath time! ♪

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:18.200
First!

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:30.370
I had the idea first!

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.910
Hmph.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:35.080
This calls for Rock, Paper, Scissors!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.200
Huh?

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:40.620
No hard feelings. Rock, paper, scissors!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:46.120
Yuzu and Shiina won. Sumire and I lost.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.620
Well, you two can bathe first, then.

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:51.040
What?

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:51.040
That's not how it works!

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:55.120
Do you think we treated Shiina unfairly?

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:57.080
Don't worry about it!

00:17:57.080 --> 00:18:01.660
Besides, he should be grateful.
He gets to bathe in our juices.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:02.910
"Juices"?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:07.000
Yuzu, that's kinda perverted.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.660
"Bath in Use"

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.660
That never happened!

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:15.830
Oh, my! You're so wet!
Shouldn't you take a bath?

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:18.000
The girls got there first.

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.700
Well, now, that's tough.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.500
I might have lucked out here.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.870
Ah! This is paradise!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.790
Sumire, hurry or you'll catch cold!

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:40.790
I'd rather not have red bath water,
so don't stimulate Sumire too much, okay?

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:41.830
Huh?

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.540
Okay. I'm coming in.

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:53.450
You have to go all the way in!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:04.700
Sumire, have you grown again?

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.580
I'm in a growth spurt.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:12.160
The height would be good, too,
but I wish you could share half your growth.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:16.700
Oh!

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:20.000
President, you've grown
two whole millimeters!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:24.000
Seriously? All right! My work paid off.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.330
Where do I even begin?

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:32.080
It's been a while since we bathed together.

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:33.410
True.

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:39.120
The next time might not be
until the field trip in the fall.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:45.750
The field trip, huh. I feel kinda bad
that we're leaving Shiina here alone.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:46.950
How come?

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.950
Ms. Ayaka's affections will be focused on him.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:54.580
Oh. Perhaps I should post
a guard while we're gone.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:57.500
Otherwise, who knows what Shiina will do.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.410
You worry too much.

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:01.950
What if we have Nana- <i>sempai</i> come?

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:04.620
She's not really the guard type.

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:09.120
That's true. Nana would probably join right in.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:12.660
Man. You really have to be more careful
when a boy's around, huh?

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:17.250
It's fun that it's so lively.
And Shiina's so cute, too.

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:18.580
Achoo!

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.080
Are you still cold?

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:24.330
That's not really the problem.

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:28.120
Shall I bring you a blanket? Or a warm drink?

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.870
No, I'm fine, really.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.870
A hot water bottle?

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.910
Maybe body heat is best.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:35.120
Calm down, Miss Caretaker!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.160
I'll take your temperature, just in case.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.910
Looks like no fever.

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:48.750
Huh? You're getting warmer...

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:51.120
Don't worry. I'm fine!

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.040
Akkun.

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:04.120
Miss Caretaker has been putting one of us
on her lap every chance she gets, lately.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:06.250
Good boy. Good boy.

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:10.620
The other day, Yuzu did this all on her own.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.370
It made me so happy.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.040
Is she a cat?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:18.790
Yuri's the only one
I haven't been a lap pillow for.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:22.790
I need to gather more experience points
in preparation for that day.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:25.580
Do lap pillows level up?

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.120
Ice cream!

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:32.080
Ice cream. Ice cream.

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:39.040
Are you gonna take a bath?

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.750
What were you two talking about?

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:49.540
We were wondering when you'd
let me be your lap pillow.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.910
Wh-Wh-What?

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.620
Come to mama!

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:56.620
Wahhh!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.830
I thought I was the only one who wanted this!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.830
Atta girl, Yuri. Atta girl.

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:42.000
"Melons, Teacher, Drunk"
